  "metaDescription": "Activist Sonam Wangchuk reported his house arrest was lifted after a court hearing as Ladakh conducts its first local body polls since becoming a territory.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Sonam Wangchuk stated his house arrest, which began on November 11, has been lifted following a court hearing.",
    "The activist has criticized the administration's governance and the scheduling of the current local government elections.",
